; Burrow — the engine. Internal modules (Catalog, Record, Index, Plan, Planner, Executor, Write,
; Oplog, Observe, Engine), each with its .mli. Sits on the storage facade + the pure codecs, and reuses
; the existing pure MongoDB query/update semantics (fennec-mongo.query) rather than re-implementing
; them: the engine's job is durable storage, indexing, and access-path selection. eio for the single
; group-committing writer fiber + reader snapshots.
(library
 (name burrow)
 (public_name fennec-mongo.burrow)
 (libraries burrow_store burrow_codec burrow_binary fennec-mongo.bson fennec-mongo.query eio eio.unix))
